{
  "_schema": "Source URL check (5.0 plan section 4.1 RadioSource.url, row 9). Each case: input (the RadioSource.url string); valid: true only for an absolute http or https URL (scheme case-insensitive) with a non-empty host. An invalid URL fails with invalidSource when played, without a network request.",
